{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00684","headline":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 紫极舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 紫极舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至道生元气，重圆法混成。\n无爲观大象，冲用体常名。\n仙乐临丹阙，云车出玉京。\n灵符百代应，瑞节九贞迎。\n宝运开皇极，天临映太清。\n长垂一德庆，永庇万方宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}